Thus the route ends with aromatic nitro fragment and core amine fragment and bromine source and sulfonyl chloride.

We also have the core amine fragment "CC(C)(C)OC(=O)N1CCNCC1" which is a simple tertiary amine with t-butyl carbamate? Actually it's a protected amine. That may be a starting material (buyable). The aromatic nitro fragment "O=[N+]([O-])c1ccc2c(c1)CCC1(CCC1)O2" also likely buyable. Bromine source "BrBr" (bromine) is buyable.

